@guide H_53_Felwood
@name Felwood (55-56)
@faction Horde
@levels 55-56
@zone Felwood
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Felwood, visit 2 of 2 on the Horde route, levels 55-56.
@next H_54_WesternPlaguelands

travel Felwood
accept 8462 Speak to Nafien
turnin 8462 Speak to Nafien
turnin 5084 Falling to Corruption
fp Bloodvenom Post
accept 4102 Cleansing Felwood | Maybess Riverbreeze, Emerald Sanctuary.
complete 4102 Cleansing Felwood | Blood Amber drops from Dessecus, Warpwood Moss Flayer and Warpwood Shredder.
turnin 4102 Cleansing Felwood
accept 5887 Salve via Hunting | Maybess Riverbreeze. Needs Cleansing Felwood turned in.
complete 5887 Salve via Hunting | Corrupted Soul Shards from Cursed Oozes in the Ruins of Constellas, west of the road.
turnin 5887 Salve via Hunting
level 56 | Western Plaguelands starts at 56. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
